---
interface Props {
  lang?: 'id' | 'en';
}

const { lang = 'id' } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF9F6] border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      
      {/* Photo / Portrait Placeholder & Badge */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
        <div class="w-44 h-44 rounded-full bg-navy-900 border-4 border-gold-500/80 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-white overflow-hidden mb-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4">
            <span class="font-editorial text-2xl font-bold text-gold-400 block mb-1">Dr. Dwi</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider block">Kaprodi & Dekan</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-navy-900 font-editorial mb-0.5">
          Dr. Dwi Wahyu Prabowo, S.Si., M.Eng.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1 font-code">
          NUPTK: 4536767668130283
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-navy-100 text-navy-900 text-[11px] font-semibold rounded mb-3">
          {isEn ? 'Head of Program & Dean of Computer Science' : 'Ketua Program Studi SI & Dekan Fakultas Ilmu Komputer'}
        </span>

        <a
          href="http://bowo.staff.unda.ac.id/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-xs text-gold-700 hover:text-gold-800 font-semibold hover:underline"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-gold-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
          </svg>
          bowo.staff.unda.ac.id
        </a>
      </div>

      {/* Message Content */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-600">
            {isEn ? 'Executive Welcome' : 'Sambutan Pimpinan'}
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 tracking-tight font-editorial">
            {isEn 
              ? 'Fostering Resilient Information Systems Architects in the AI Era' 
              : 'Menempa Arsitek Sistem Informasi yang Tangguh di Era Kecerdasan Buatan'}
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
          {isEn ? (
            <>
              <p>
                Welcome to the official website of the Undergraduate Program in Information Systems at Universitas Darwan Ali. In this transformative technological epoch, systems engineering is no longer solely about database queries or routine programming; it is about building ethical, data-driven, and intelligent solutions that empower society.
              </p>
              <p>
                Our 144-credit Outcome-Based Education (OBE) curriculum is meticulously curated to bridge academic rigor with industrial needs. Through five specialized research groups — spanning Artificial Intelligence, Enterprise Systems, Multimedia UI/UX, Data Science, and Educational Technology — we ensure our graduates are not mere consumers of tech, but active inventors and architects.
              </p>
            </>
          ) : (
            <>
              <p>
                Selamat datang di portal resmi Program Studi S1 Sistem Informasi, Fakultas Ilmu Komputer, Universitas Darwan Ali. Di tengah laju revolusi kecerdasan buatan dan integrasi data global, tantangan kita adalah mencetak sarjana yang tidak hanya menguasai perkakas teknologi, tetapi juga berintegritas tinggi, berjiwa analitis, dan adaptif terhadap persoalan nyata bangsa.
              </p>
              <p>
                Melalui penerapan kurikulum Outcome-Based Education (OBE) 144 SKS yang terstruktur dan terukur serta dukungan 5 Kelompok Riset Dosen yang aktif mempublikasikan karya di jurnal internasional bereputasi, kami membekali mahasiswa dengan kapabilitas riset, rekayasa proses bisnis, dan kecakapan AI yang siap bersaing di kancah nasional maupun internasional.
              </p>
            </>
          )}
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a
            href={isEn ? '/en/about/' : '/profil/'}
            class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-navy-900 hover:text-gold-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-4 py-2 rounded transition-colors"
          >
            {isEn ? 'Read Vision & Mission →' : 'Baca Visi, Misi & Struktur Prodi →'}
          </a>
          <a
            href={isEn ? '/en/faculty/dr-dwi-wahyu-prabowo-s-si-m-eng' : '/civitas/dosen/dr-dwi-wahyu-prabowo-s-si-m-eng'}
            class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-navy-900 hover:underline"
          >
            {isEn ? 'View Dr. Dwi Wahyu Prabowo Academic Profile' : 'Lihat Profil Akademik Dr. Dwi Wahyu Prabowo'}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
